  "description": "Expanding Horizon 8.0 – Electronics and Communication Engineering (ECE) Organized by: Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad Expanding Horizon 8.0 – ECE is an initiative by the Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad, aimed at helping students strengthen their core electronics and communication concepts and prepare for upcoming internship opportunities. The assessment focuses on evaluating fundamental technical knowledge, conceptual understanding, and analytical problem-solving skills across important areas of Electronics and Communication Engineering. Objectives Strengthen fundamentals of electronic circuits and devices. Evaluate knowledge of Analog and Digital Electronics. Assess understanding of Signals and Systems. Test concepts related to Communication Systems. Encourage analytical thinking and application-based problem-solving. Help participants identify areas for technical improvement. Guidelines The assessment will be conducted online through Unstop. Participants must attempt the questions within the stipulated time. Answers will be evaluated according to predefined assessment criteria. Unfair means, plagiarism, or collaboration during the assessment are prohibited. The decision of the organizing team will be final. Strengthen Your Concepts. Test Your Knowledge. Expand Your Horizons!",
