    "details": "<p><strong>Expanding Horizon 8.0 &ndash; Electronics and Communication Engineering (ECE)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Organized by: Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad</strong></p>\n<p>Expanding Horizon 8.0 &ndash; ECE is an initiative by the Student Mentorship Program (SMP), MNNIT Allahabad, aimed at helping students strengthen their core electronics and communication concepts and prepare for upcoming internship opportunities.</p>\n<p>The assessment focuses on evaluating fundamental technical knowledge, conceptual understanding, and analytical problem-solving skills across important areas of Electronics and Communication Engineering.</p>\n<p><strong>Objectives</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strengthen fundamentals of electronic circuits and devices.</li>\n<li>Evaluate knowledge of Analog and Digital Electronics.</li>\n<li>Assess understanding of Signals and Systems.</li>\n<li>Test concepts related to Communication Systems.</li>\n<li>Encourage analytical thinking and application-based problem-solving.</li>\n<li>Help participants identify areas for technical improvement.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Guidelines</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The assessment will be conducted online through Unstop.</li>\n<li>Participants must attempt the questions within the stipulated time.</li>\n<li>Answers will be evaluated according to predefined assessment criteria.</li>\n<li>Unfair means, plagiarism, or collaboration during the assessment are prohibited.</li>\n<li>The decision of the organizing team will be final.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Strengthen Your Concepts. Test Your Knowledge. Expand Your Horizons!</strong></p>",
